{"version":1,"content":"<p>【痴線 😱】自從有了 AI 之後，以前認為不可能的事都變得無限可能！</p><p>知名獨立開發者 Yeo Kheng Meng 日前展示，成功借助 AI 以反編譯的方式，將 Windows 7 的 xHCI 驅動程式移植至 Windows 98 SE 以及後續多款經典作業系統，帶來了 USB4 與 Thunderbolt 3/4 主機控制器的實驗性支援，甚至實現了現代周邊設備的熱插拔功能。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T12:00:29.237229+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:39:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T19:17:38.823126+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:57:48.856281+00:00","content_hash":"1b38fb6865311d75f669206d6dc54f263817728984f5e2b208614a94bed79553","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}